{"_id":"0207a60b3f242cb5","name":"Bear","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"details":{"level":5,"xp":0,"nextLevel":0,"className":"","race":"Beasts","alignment":"Neutral","biography":"Not naturally aggressive, bears fiercely defend their own. While mostly nocturnal, a hungry bear may roam boldly even under the midday sun."},"attributes":{"str":{"score":21},"vit":{"score":19},"agi":{"score":13},"int":{"score":2},"mnd":{"score":12},"cha":{"score":6}},"skills":{"perception":{"trained":true,"total":8},"survival":{"trained":true,"total":8},"unarmed":{"trained":true,"total":17}},"defences":{"ref":{"total":15},"fort":{"total":19},"will":{"total":16}},"resources":{"hp":{"value":55,"max":55,"baseMax":55},"mp":{"value":0,"max":0}},"combat":{"initiativeDie":"1d8","speed":8,"baseSpeed":8,"damageReduction":5,"baseDamageReduction":5,"breakThreshold":24,"immunities":[],"resistances":[],"vulnerabilities":[]},"adversary":{"isAdversary":true,"category":"Beasts","profile":"beast","cr":4,"level":5,"xp":800,"size":"large","species":"Beasts","profileLine":"Neutral Large Beast 5; Territorial","classLevels":"","alignment":"Neutral","temperament":"Territorial","description":"Not naturally aggressive, bears fiercely defend their own. While mostly nocturnal, a hungry bear may roam boldly even under the midday sun.","languages":"","speedText":"8","initiativeDie":"1d8","senses":"Low-light Vision, Scent;","passivePerception":18,"attributes":{"str":21,"agi":13,"vit":19,"int":2,"mnd":12,"cha":6},"defences":{"ref":15,"flatFootedRef":14,"fort":19,"will":16},"damageReduction":5,"breakThreshold":24,"immunities":[],"resistances":[],"weaknesses":[],"skills":[{"name":"Perception","bonus":8,"key":"perception"},{"name":"Survival","bonus":8,"key":"survival"},{"name":"Unarmed","bonus":17,"key":"unarmed"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Bite","attack":17,"damage":"1d8+7","mode":"melee","type":"piercing"},{"name":"Claws","attack":17,"damage":"1d6+7","mode":"melee","type":"slashing"}],"abilities":[{"name":"Gnaw","description":"Whenever a bear pins a target, it may make a free bite attack that ignores non-magickal DR."},{"name":"Protective","description":"Whenever a bear attacks an enemy that is threatening one of their allies, the bear may reroll the attack, keeping the higher result."}],"spells":[],"performances":[],"equipped":"","loot":"Moondust (5%), Beast Fang (50%), Beast Mane (95%)","steal":"Panacea (5%)","sourcePage":286}},"prototypeToken":{"name":"Bear","texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg"},"width":2,"height":2,"actorLink":false,"disposition":0,"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"bar1":{"attribute":"resources.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"resources.mp"}},"items":[{"_id":"f69e644de1d16e4e","name":"Bite","type":"weapon","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/generic/auto-attack.webp","system":{"weaponGroup":"natural","weaponSkill":"unarmed","range":"Melee","damage":{"formula":"1d8+7","type":"piercing"},"attack":{"bonus":0},"npcStaticAttack":true,"specialRules":"Attack and damage values use this adversary's printed stat block."},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"be9382bc3f7f7d4f","name":"Claws","type":"weapon","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/generic/auto-attack.webp","system":{"weaponGroup":"natural","weaponSkill":"unarmed","range":"Melee","damage":{"formula":"1d6+7","type":"slashing"},"attack":{"bonus":0},"npcStaticAttack":true,"specialRules":"Attack and damage values use this adversary's printed stat block."},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"90026f3d991fd787","name":"Gnaw","type":"feature","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/generic/auto-attack.webp","system":{"category":"Special Ability","description":"Whenever a bear pins a target, it may make a free bite attack that ignores non-magickal DR.","automation":{"kind":"adversaryAbility"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"50bb43f974b2f824","name":"Protective","type":"feature","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/AST/The_Arrow.webp","system":{"category":"Special Ability","description":"Whenever a bear attacks an enemy that is threatening one of their allies, the bear may reroll the attack, keeping the higher result.","automation":{"kind":"adversaryAbility"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"0c11d9090c409210","name":"HP Up","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/WAR/Thrill_of_Battle.webp","system":{"description":"Increase maximum HP by 5 + your character level.","effects":{"resources":{"hpMaxFlat":5,"hpMaxPerLevel":1}},"category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"692d9a80925cfe35","name":"Pin","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/DRG/Fang_and_Claw.webp","system":{"description":"A successful grapple pins the target until your next turn. It becomes prone and flat-footed and can take only one minor action on its next turn; you are also prone and flat-footed while maintaining the pin.","category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"acbef5c5ec8cb68f","name":"Skill Focus (unarmed)","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/SCH/Adloquium.webp","system":{"description":"Choose a trained skill and gain +5 to its checks. Each additional copy must apply to a different trained skill.","repeatable":true,"choice":{"type":"trainedSkill"},"effects":{"selectedSkillBonus":5},"selectedSkill":"unarmed","category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}],"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"f536d29f18142d93","name":"Griffon","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"details":{"level":5,"xp":0,"nextLevel":0,"className":"","race":"Beasts","alignment":"Pure","biography":"Majestic and proud, these beasts reign over Lagryss’s skies and symbolize nobility and strength."},"attributes":{"str":{"score":20},"vit":{"score":18},"agi":{"score":17},"int":{"score":6},"mnd":{"score":13},"cha":{"score":10}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"trained":true,"total":10},"lore-terrestrial":{"trained":true,"total":5},"perception":{"trained":true,"total":13},"survival":{"trained":true,"total":8},"unarmed":{"trained":true,"total":17}},"defences":{"ref":{"total":18},"fort":{"total":20},"will":{"total":17}},"resources":{"hp":{"value":45,"max":45,"baseMax":45},"mp":{"value":0,"max":0}},"combat":{"initiativeDie":"1d8","speed":6,"baseSpeed":6,"damageReduction":5,"baseDamageReduction":5,"breakThreshold":25,"immunities":["Disease"],"resistances":[],"vulnerabilities":[]},"adversary":{"isAdversary":true,"category":"Beasts","profile":"beast","cr":4,"level":5,"xp":800,"size":"large","species":"Beasts","profileLine":"Pure Neutral Large Beast 5; Territorial","classLevels":"","alignment":"Pure","temperament":"Territorial","description":"Majestic and proud, these beasts reign over Lagryss’s skies and symbolize nobility and strength.","languages":"","speedText":"6, Fly 16","initiativeDie":"1d8","senses":"Dark Vision, Scent; Passive Perception 23","passivePerception":23,"attributes":{"str":20,"agi":17,"vit":18,"int":6,"mnd":13,"cha":10},"defences":{"ref":18,"flatFootedRef":15,"fort":20,"will":17},"damageReduction":5,"breakThreshold":25,"immunities":["Disease"],"resistances":[],"weaknesses":[],"skills":[{"name":"Acrobatics","bonus":10,"key":"acrobatics"},{"name":"Lore (terrestrial)","bonus":5,"key":"lore-terrestrial"},{"name":"Perception","bonus":13,"key":"perception"},{"name":"Survival","bonus":8,"key":"survival"},{"name":"Unarmed","bonus":17,"key":"unarmed"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Bite","attack":17,"damage":"1d8+7","mode":"melee","type":"piercing"},{"name":"Claws","attack":17,"damage":"1d6+7","mode":"melee","type":"slashing"}],"abilities":[{"name":"Gust*","description":"As a primary action, a griffon may make an attack roll (d20+16) against the Fort Defence of all targets within a 6 square cone. If successful, targets take 4d6+6 slashing damage and are moved 2 squares directly away from the griffon. Otherwise, targets take half damage and are not moved. Creatures that are larger than the griffon ignore the forced movement, even upon success. The griffon may not use this ability again on the following turn. This is an area effect."},{"name":"Soar","description":"As minor action, griffons can grant themselves hover until the end of their next turn. When this effect ends, the griffon may not use this ability again for 1d4+1 turns."}],"spells":[],"performances":[],"equipped":"","loot":"Great Feather (20%), Storm Crystal (50%), Beast Mane (95%)","steal":"Philter (50%), Health Potion (95%)","sourcePage":286}},"prototypeToken":{"name":"Griffon","texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg"},"width":2,"height":2,"actorLink":false,"disposition":1,"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"bar1":{"attribute":"resources.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"resources.mp"}},"items":[{"_id":"6a5c955b261424bf","name":"Bite","type":"weapon","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/generic/auto-attack.webp","system":{"weaponGroup":"natural","weaponSkill":"unarmed","range":"Melee","damage":{"formula":"1d8+7","type":"piercing"},"attack":{"bonus":0},"npcStaticAttack":true,"specialRules":"Attack and damage values use this adversary's printed stat block."},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"942555e74baa33ee","name":"Claws","type":"weapon","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/generic/auto-attack.webp","system":{"weaponGroup":"natural","weaponSkill":"unarmed","range":"Melee","damage":{"formula":"1d6+7","type":"slashing"},"attack":{"bonus":0},"npcStaticAttack":true,"specialRules":"Attack and damage values use this adversary's printed stat block."},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"474cdaa467e33973","name":"Gust*","type":"feature","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/WAR/The_Beast_Within.webp","system":{"category":"Special Ability","description":"As a primary action, a griffon may make an attack roll (d20+16) against the Fort Defence of all targets within a 6 square cone. If successful, targets take 4d6+6 slashing damage and are moved 2 squares directly away from the griffon. Otherwise, targets take half damage and are not moved. Creatures that are larger than the griffon ignore the forced movement, even upon success. The griffon may not use this ability again on the following turn. This is an area effect.","automation":{"kind":"adversaryAbility"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"af28e95483974d32","name":"Soar","type":"feature","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/AST/The_Arrow.webp","system":{"category":"Special Ability","description":"As minor action, griffons can grant themselves hover until the end of their next turn. When this effect ends, the griffon may not use this ability again for 1d4+1 turns.","automation":{"kind":"adversaryAbility"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"49b536ab87545b82","name":"Defence Up","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/PLD/Bulwark.webp","system":{"description":"Gain +1 to Fortitude, Reflex, and Will Defence.","effects":{"defenceBonuses":{"fort":1,"ref":1,"will":1}},"category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"ca37c17d84f2d869","name":"Skill Focus (Perception, Unarmed)","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/SCH/Adloquium.webp","system":{"description":"Choose a trained skill and gain +5 to its checks. Each additional copy must apply to a different trained skill.","repeatable":true,"choice":{"type":"trainedSkill"},"effects":{"selectedSkillBonus":5},"selectedSkill":"perception, unarmed","category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}],"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
