ogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/AST/The_Arrow.webp","system":{"category":"Special Ability","description":"Whenever a wild boar is reduced to 0 HP , it is not moved to the bottom of the Break Gauge, remaining conscious. Until the end of its next turn, while it remains at 0 HP , it may only take a single primary action, after which it dies. However, it still dies if the damage beat its threshold.","automation":{"kind":"adversaryAbility"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"abe574548ab64edb","name":"Tusk","type":"feature","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/AST/The_Arrow.webp","system":{"category":"Special Ability","description":"Whenever the wild boar successfully hits a target with its gore attack at the end of a charge, the damage ignores non-magickal DR.","automation":{"kind":"adversaryAbility"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"78139c6e51cc379c","name":"HP Up","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/WAR/Thrill_of_Battle.webp","system":{"description":"Increase maximum HP by 5 + your character level.","effects":{"resources":{"hpMaxFlat":5,"hpMaxPerLevel":1}},"category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"2e053b6ba84f2069","name":"Powerful Charge","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/DRG/Lance_Charge.webp","system":{"description":"Gain +2 on attacks made while charging and deal additional damage equal to half your character level.","category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"40c0cd6b36b163be","name":"Skill Focus (unarmed)","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/SCH/Adloquium.webp","system":{"description":"Choose a trained skill and gain +5 to its checks. Each additional copy must apply to a different trained skill.","repeatable":true,"choice":{"type":"trai