ld beat its Threshold.","automation":{"kind":"adversaryAbility"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"0d72cd922006b2a7","name":"Overthrow","type":"feature","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/AST/The_Arrow.webp","system":{"category":"Special Ability","description":"Whenever an ogre bear successfully deals damage to a target with its gore attack at the end of a charge, they may choose to move the target 3 squares away from them in any direction. This is a stun.","automation":{"kind":"adversaryAbility"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"61da17fff6cdaac0","name":"Defence Up","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/PLD/Bulwark.webp","system":{"description":"Gain +1 to Fortitude, Reflex, and Will Defence.","effects":{"defenceBonuses":{"fort":1,"ref":1,"will":1}},"category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"3f26e64ad2f4c878","name":"HP Up","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/WAR/Thrill_of_Battle.webp","system":{"description":"Increase maximum HP by 5 + your character level.","effects":{"resources":{"hpMaxFlat":5,"hpMaxPerLevel":1}},"category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"119aa88e4f400280","name":"Mighty Strikes","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/AST/The_Arrow.webp","system":{"description":"Before an attack, choose a penalty up to -1 on melee attacks and gain the same bonus to melee damage until your next turn. The limit increases by 1 at character level 4 and every 4 levels thereafter, to -5/+5; two-handed weapons double the damage bonus.","prerequisites":{"attributes":{"str":13}},"category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"58e780f1accb66ea","name":"Powerful Charge","type":"technick